{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"734","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A. Anton and Danik"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Anton likes to play chess, and so does his friend Danik."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Once they have played "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" games in a row. For each game it's known who was the winner — Anton or Danik. None of the games ended with a tie."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Now Anton wonders, who won more games, he or Danik? Help him determine this."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of the input contains a single integer "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ n ≤ 100 000"},{"kind":"text","text":") — the number of games played."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line contains a string "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"s"},{"kind":"text","text":", consisting of "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" uppercase English letters '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"' and '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"D"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"' — the outcome of each of the games. The "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th character of the string is equal to '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"' if the Anton won the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th game and '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"D"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"' if Danik won the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th game."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"If Anton won more games than Danik, print \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Anton"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" (without quotes) in the only line of the output."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"If Danik won more games than Anton, print \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Danik"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" (without quotes) in the only line of the output."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"If Anton and Danik won the same number of games, print \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Friendship"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" (without quotes)."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"6\nADAAAA\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"Anton\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"s